ct Extreme Weather Events 6 Weeks in Advance", "title_en": "Artificial Intelligence Will Predict Extreme Weather Events 6 Weeks in Advance", "url": "https://kantan.news/news/artificial-intelligence-will-predict-extreme-weather-events-6-weeks-in-advance"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-15T08:52:51Z", "source_name": "noticiassin.com", "title": "IA mejora el pronóstico meteorológico a largo plazo", "title_en": "AI improves long-range weather forecasting", "url": "https://noticiassin.com/mundo/ciencia/2026/10/14/ia-mejora-el-pronostico-meteorologico-a-largo-plazo-2143543"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-15T08:52:51Z", "source_name": "noticiassin.com", "title": "IA mejora el pronóstico meteorológico a 6 semanas", "title_en": "AI improves 6-week weather forecasting", "url": "https://noticiassin.com/tecnologia/2026/10/14/ia-mejora-el-pronostico-meteorologico-a-6-semanas-2143545"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-15T08:52:51Z", "source_name": "infobae.com", "title": "Una nueva herramienta de IA mejora el pronóstico meteorológico a un plazo de 2 a 6 semanas - Infobae", "title_en": "A new AI tool improves weather forecasting at a 2 to 6 week range", "url": "https://www.infobae.com/america/agencias/2026/10/14/una-nueva-herramienta-de-ia-mejora-el-pronostico-meteorologico-a-un-plazo-de-2-a-6-semanas/"}, {"language": "en", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:44:13Z", "source_name": "suaragarut.id", "title": "AI Framework Improves Weather Forecasts Up to Six Weeks Ahead", "title_en": "AI Framework Improves Weather Forecasts Up to Six Weeks Ahead", "url": "https://suaragarut.id/en/ai-framework-improves-weather-forecasts"}, {"language": "es", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:52:51Z", "source_name": "fayerwayer.com", "title": "Una IA logra pronosticar tormentas con un mes de antelación", "title_en": "An AI manages to forecast storms a month in advance", "url": "https://www.fayerwayer.com/internet/2026/10/15/una-ia-logra-pronosticar-tormentas-con-un-m