tection of floods and extreme heat waves.", "system_names": ["Probabilistic Bias Correction", "PBC", "PBC model"], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model", "ml_dl"], "title": "Artificial intelligence manages to predict the weather six weeks in advance", "value_added": "Improves predictions at 2 to 6 weeks lead time and enables earlier detection of floods and extreme heat waves.", "value_types": ["accuracy", "lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["IV"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(7,'ai nowcast|operational_implementation','forecasting','2026-10-17T08:57:17Z','2026-10-18T03:03:26Z','2026-10-15','{"areas": ["forecasting"], "confidence": 0.95, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-15", "event_name": "AI-Nowcast", "first_seen": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "id": 7, "institution_types": ["private_sector"], "institutions": [{"country": "JP", "name": "ウェザーニューズ", "short_name": "WeatherNews", "type": "private_sector"}], "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-18T03:03:26Z", "news_type": "operational_implementation", "news_types": ["model_release", "operational_implementation"], "primary_area": "forecasting", "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-15T08:48:38Z", "source_name": "news.mynavi.jp", "title": "3時間先までの強雨をAIで予測、ウェザーニューズが「AI-Nowcast」本格実装", "title_en": "WeatherNews implements AI-Nowcast to forecast heavy rain up to 3 hours ahead", "url": "https://news.mynavi.jp/techplus/article/20261015-5132256/"}, {"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-17T03:03:21Z", "source_name": "ai.watch.impress.co.jp", "title": "ウェザーニューズ、目先の予測精度を向上した「AI-Nowcast」 - AI Watch", "title_en": "Weathernews improves short-term forecast accuracy with ''AI-Nowcast''", "url": "https://ai.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/2148796.html"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "ウェザーニューズが、3時間先までの強い雨をAIで予測する「AI-Nowcast」を本格実装した。短時間の強雨予測に用いられる。"}, "summary_en": "WeatherNews, a Japanese private weather company, has fully implemented \"AI-Nowcast,\" an AI system that predicts heavy rainfall up to three hours ahead. The system is aimed at nowcasting applications, extending short-term warning capability for strong rain.", "system_names": ["AI-Nowcast"], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model", "ml_dl"], "title": "WeatherNews implements AI-Nowcast to forecast heavy rain up to 3 hours ahead", "value_added": "Provides AI-based forecasts of heavy rain up to 3 hours ahead (nowcasting).", "value_types": ["accuracy", "lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(8,'','forecasting','2026-10-17T08:57:22Z','2026-10-17T08:48:44Z','2026-10-16','{"areas": ["forecasting"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "id": 8, "institution_types": ["private_sector"], "institutions": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Weathernews Inc.", "short_name": "Weathernews", "type": "private_sector"}], "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "news_type": "other", "news_types": ["other"], "primary_area": "forecasting", "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:48:38Z", "source_name": "weathernews.jp", "title": "台風30号 AI予測は西寄り 物理モデルもAI予測に近づく傾向 - ウェザーニュース", "title_en": "Typhoon No. 30 AI forecast leans west; physical models also trending toward AI forecasts - Weathernews", "url": "https://weathernews.jp/news/202610/160151/"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "台風30号の進路について、従来の物理モデルとAI予測モデルで傾向に違いが見られ、物理モデルもAI予測に近づく傾向があると伝えられています。ウェザーニューズは進路予測を最大10日先まで延長したとしています。"}, "summary_en": "Weathernews reports that the track forecast for Typhoon No. 30 differs between conventional physical models and AI forecast models, with physical models increasingly resembling AI predictions. The company says it has extended its typhoon track forecasts to as far as 10 days ahead.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model"], "title": "Typhoon No. 30 AI forecast leans west; physical models also trending toward AI forecasts - Weathernews", "value_added": "Extends typhoon track forecasts out to up to 10 days ahead, as stated by the company.", "value_types": ["lead_time"], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
INSERT INTO "stories" VALUES(9,'','forecasting','2026-10-17T08:57:22Z','2026-10-17T08:48:44Z','2026-10-16','{"areas": ["forecasting", "communication"], "confidence": 0.8, "countries": [{"code": "JP", "name": "Japan"}], "event_date": "2026-10-16", "event_name": null, "first_seen": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "id": 9, "institution_types": ["NMHS"], "institutions": [{"country": "JP", "name": "Japan Meteorological Agency", "short_name": "JMA", "type": "NMHS"}], "languages": ["ja"], "last_updated": "2026-10-17T08:48:44Z", "news_type": "other", "news_types": ["other"], "primary_area": "forecasting", "review": false, "sources": [{"language": "ja", "published_at": "2026-10-16T08:48:38Z", "source_name": "kka-ai.com", "title": "AIで天気予報はどう変わる?|気象庁と海外のAI気象モデル、ゲリラ雷雨の捉え方、AIに天気を聞くときの注意 - AI・DXお役立ちサイト", "title_en": "How AI will change weather forecasting? JMA and overseas AI weather models, capturing guerrilla thunderstorms, and cautions when asking AI about weather", "url": "https://www.kka-ai.com/ai-weather-forecast/"}], "summaries_original": {"ja": "気象庁がAI気象モデルの開発に着手したこと、AIと気象庁予報の比較を紹介する解説記事です。ただし公開日が2026-10-11で、対象期間(10月14日以降)外のため参考扱いです。"}, "summary_en": "An explanatory article on the Japan Meteorological Agency starting development of an AI weather model, with a comparison of AI and JMA forecasts. It also covers overseas AI weather models, localized thunderstorms, and cautions when consulting generative AI about weather. The article is dated 2026-10-11, outside the stated review window, so it is treated as reference material only.", "system_names": [], "techniques": ["ai_weather_model", "llm_genai"], "title": "How AI will change weather forecasting? JMA and overseas AI weather models, capturing guerrilla thunderstorms, and cautions when asking AI about weather", "value_added": null, "value_types": [], "wmo_regions": ["II"]}');
